WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.850
[Audience applauding]

00:00:00.850 --> 00:00:02.010
- Now we have a small

00:00:02.010 --> 00:00:03.490
but mighty virtual audience here today.

00:00:03.490 --> 00:00:05.450
It's made up of all Marvel fans

00:00:05.450 --> 00:00:08.440
and some of whom I'm told
have questions for me.

00:00:08.440 --> 00:00:09.951
Hello. Hi, how's it going?

00:00:09.951 --> 00:00:10.784
- Hey

00:00:10.784 --> 00:00:11.617
[Inaudible]

00:00:11.617 --> 00:00:13.220
It's so nice to meet you.

00:00:13.220 --> 00:00:15.870
I am a huge fan of yours.

00:00:15.870 --> 00:00:18.360
I'm also a mom of two little boys

00:00:18.360 --> 00:00:20.590
who are even bigger fans of yours.

00:00:20.590 --> 00:00:22.391
In fact, I have a five year old son,

00:00:22.391 --> 00:00:24.230
Rowan, and he's really

00:00:24.230 --> 00:00:26.360
into Marvel and superheroes.

00:00:26.360 --> 00:00:28.340
So when Shanty first came out,

00:00:28.340 --> 00:00:30.760
he just lit up when he saw a superhero

00:00:30.760 --> 00:00:33.170
that looked like him on screen.

00:00:33.170 --> 00:00:35.360
And actually it inspired him so much.

00:00:35.360 --> 00:00:38.150
He wanted to sign up for
martial arts classes.

00:00:38.150 --> 00:00:39.410
So he's doing that now.

00:00:39.410 --> 00:00:41.820
He's loving it and he's kind of a shy kid

00:00:41.820 --> 00:00:43.240
but he's really blossomed

00:00:43.240 --> 00:00:45.110
and his confidence has just come out.

00:00:45.110 --> 00:00:48.044
So, I wanna thank you for
being the inspiration.

00:00:48.044 --> 00:00:50.880
- Oh my goodness. Thank you.
[Audience Applauding]

00:00:50.880 --> 00:00:53.060
- So my fan question for you is,

00:00:53.060 --> 00:00:55.000
if you could pick a film from the past

00:00:55.000 --> 00:00:58.401
that you weren't in,
what film would that be?

00:00:58.401 --> 00:01:00.500
And my question from my son Rowan,

00:01:00.500 --> 00:01:03.233
is what's your martial arts move?

00:01:04.210 --> 00:01:05.043
- Oh my God.

00:01:05.043 --> 00:01:05.876
Great questions.

00:01:05.876 --> 00:01:07.770
First of all, thank you so much.

00:01:07.770 --> 00:01:09.193
Those are such kind words.

00:01:10.250 --> 00:01:11.800
Movie that I would be in.

00:01:11.800 --> 00:01:14.740
Oh my G.. I, my favorite movie growing up

00:01:14.740 --> 00:01:18.440
was Jurassic Park and I just think

00:01:18.440 --> 00:01:20.860
what an incredible film to be a part of,

00:01:20.860 --> 00:01:23.740
I mean Spielberg obviously
a legendary filmmaker.

00:01:23.740 --> 00:01:25.270
So I would go with either Jurassic Park,

00:01:25.270 --> 00:01:27.210
or like Indiana Jones.

00:01:27.210 --> 00:01:28.660
I feel like those would be

00:01:28.660 --> 00:01:31.480
just such incredible adventures to be on.

00:01:31.480 --> 00:01:33.720
And then in terms of
favorite martial arts movie,

00:01:33.720 --> 00:01:37.098
oh, I gotta go with Rush Hour 2 actually.

00:01:37.098 --> 00:01:38.690
[Audience applauding]

00:01:38.690 --> 00:01:40.790
The scene in the massage parlor

00:01:40.790 --> 00:01:42.683
is just absolute hilarious.

00:01:44.350 --> 00:01:45.410
So, there you go.

00:01:45.410 --> 00:01:46.420
Say hi to your boys for me.

00:01:46.420 --> 00:01:47.253
Thank you so much.

00:01:47.253 --> 00:01:48.203
[Audience Clapping]

